# Kinich Mavuika Bennett Escoffier. ~19s Rot. Kinich Mavuika Burnmelt. Attempts 5[N2 shE] spinning clockwise consistently. Kinich bursts at the end of his field time if available. Mavuika Melts her burst every rotation and applies Scroll as Escoffier clears Burning. Bennett catches Mavuika's particles.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
kinich char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kinich add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
kinich add set="oc" count=4;
kinich add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
kinich add stats def%=0.062*2 def=19.68*2 hp=253.94*2 hp%=0.0496*2 atk=16.54*2 atk%=0.0496*6 er=0.0551*4 em=19.82*2 cr=0.0331*8 cd=0.0662*10;

mavuika char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
mavuika add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=0];
